LAND LEASE

This Land Lease (“Lease”), is dated as of ____________,2024 (“Effective Date”) by and between
the following:

Lessor
Lessor:
Swan Ranch Cheyenne Rail, L.L.C.
Entity:
A Wyoming limited liability company
Mailing Address:
315 W. Third Street
City, State, Zip:
Pittsburg, KS 66762

And

Lessee
Lessee:
City of Cheyenne
Entity:
A Wyoming Municipal Corporation
Mailing Address:
2101 O’Neil Avenue
City, State, Zip:
Cheyenne, WY 82001

This Lease supersedes and replaces that certain Railcar Storage Agreement, designated City Contract
#7665, by and between Cheyenne Rail Hub, LLC and Lessee, dated January 1, 2023, and any
subsequent amendments thereto.

Lessor desires to lease property to Lessee for and in consideration of the mutual benefits and
obligations set forth in this Lease, the Lessor and Lessee agree to be bound on as follows:

1. LEASED PREMISES.

Lessor hereby leases to Lessee the Land, located in the County of Laramie, and State of
Wyoming (“Leased Premises”), and on a non-exclusive basis, the Non-Exclusive Ingress and
Egress drive, both being approximately depicted on Exhibit A herein.

2. TERM/TERMINATION.

2.1.
The term of this Lease (“Term”) shall be for one (1) year commencing on June 1, 2024
(“Commencement Date”) and unless sooner terminated as hereinafter provided expire
on May 31, 2025 (the “Term”).

11:35 am, Jul 02 2024
```

